---
{
  title: "colourp"
}
---
### NAME

    colourp() - Returns 1 if the string contains colour codes, 0 if not.

### SYNOPSIS

    int colourp( string str );

### DESCRIPTION

    Returns 1 if the string contains colour codes, 0 if not.

### PARAMETERS

    str  (string)
         The string to check.

### RETURN VALUES

    (int) 1 if the string contains colour codes, otherwise 0.
